WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Speaker 1: When it comes to vaccine mandates,&nbsp;
there are really two or three major questions.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:12.000
Are they legal? Are they moral and do they&nbsp;
work now? Are they legal? Is something that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.920
in the United States is essentially&nbsp;
settled. Now you'll hear people say&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:21.680
it's unconstitutional. These are the same people&nbsp;
that say the 2020 election was unconstitutional.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:25.040
We asked them, Well, what? What exactly was&nbsp;
violated from the Constitution? They don't know.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:29.840
But the legality of vaccine requirements,&nbsp;
particularly when there's a test out policy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.760
is is really without question at this point&nbsp;
in time, even without a test out policy for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.360
things like attending school or whatever the&nbsp;
case may be. We've had examples of these going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:44.400
back more than 100 years in the United States, in&nbsp;
different places. The legality, no matter what you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:50.000
hear on wherever, Facebook, right wing media,&nbsp;
etc., the legality is really not in question.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:56.000
The morality is a different type of question. When&nbsp;
we think about questions that we want to answer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
the first thing we have is we have to determine&nbsp;
what kind of a question it is. Zero is a question&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.240
with an empirical answer how much hydrogen&nbsp;
is there in atmospheric air that we breathe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:12.320
or whatever. That's one type of question. Is it&nbsp;
wrong to steal bread to feed your family? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:18.000
OK, that's it. But if you're morally, that's&nbsp;
a judgment call. And the question of morality&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
is more of a judgment call, and it can be debated&nbsp;
and it's not what we're doing today. The third&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.600
question is do vaccine mandates work? And there&nbsp;
are many on the right who have sought to make it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:36.560
seem like vaccine mandates don't work by talking&nbsp;
about the number of whatever that are threatening&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:42.800
to quit if they have to get vaccinated, saying&nbsp;
they will quit writing a letter stating they will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:48.720
quit. And every single time that that happens,&nbsp;
I take the position of let's not go by what the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:54.960
union is threatening. Let's not go by what people&nbsp;
are posting on social media. Let's just go by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:00.080
number of people that actually quit. And we have&nbsp;
a new data point and it's from the New York Police&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:07.520
Department. Despite threats and hyperbole that&nbsp;
up to a third of NYPD might quit over the vaccine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:16.080
mandate, 10000 officers might quit as of this&nbsp;
morning. Thirty four officers have defied the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:25.360
vaccine mandate out of 36000, meaning zero point&nbsp;
zero nine percent. There is literally no effect on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:32.160
service at this point, says New York City Police&nbsp;
Commissioner Dermot Shea. New York City's vaccine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:38.560
mandate for municipal workers has taken effect.&nbsp;
And just 34 police officers have refused it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:45.360
a far cry from the 10000 threatened by the&nbsp;
NYPD union under the mandate announced by Mayor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:50.960
Bill de Blasio, all city municipal employees,&nbsp;
including police, firefighters and civil servants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:56.560
must either get vaccinated or be put on unpaid&nbsp;
leave. Hundreds of city workers protested the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.560 --> 00:03:00.880
mandate and the New York Police Department's&nbsp;
largest union, the Police Benevolent Association,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:06.160
claimed it would take thousands of cops&nbsp;
off the streets. As of Thursday morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:12.080
the PBA warned last week there were ten&nbsp;
thousand unvaccinated uniformed NYPD members,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:17.040
which equals the staffing of dozens of patrol&nbsp;
precincts who will be barred from reporting for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:21.520
duty on Monday, November one, unless they have&nbsp;
applied for religious or medical exemption.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:27.360
The union's president, Patrick Lynch, particularly&nbsp;
slammed Police Commissioner Dermot Shea&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:31.520
for going along with the plan. Commissioner&nbsp;
Shea and his team should have told the mayor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:37.760
this mandate and his arbitrary Friday deadline.&nbsp;
We're going to throw NYPD operations into chaos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:44.000
on Monday, however, the chaos failed to&nbsp;
materialize. Less than three dozen NYPD officers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:50.080
were put on unpaid leave, and the department&nbsp;
reported no interruption in service. Here&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:58.800
is Andrew Giuliani. Rudy Giuliani's son, who's&nbsp;
running for governor, saying 27 percent of NYPD&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:04.160
may be gone. Take a look from police department
Speaker 3: issue and staffing. We're looking at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:10.160
potentially losing twenty seven percent of&nbsp;
the NYPD at this moment. I think 73 percent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:17.200
of the NYPD has actually lost. Has the vaccine.
Speaker 1: So my position has continued to be,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:25.200
let's see how many of them actually do it. And&nbsp;
the real number is thirty four out of 36000. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:33.120
remember? What is the question we are answering?&nbsp;
The fact that it's only 34 doesn't mean the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:40.080
vaccine mandate is morally right. I believe it is,&nbsp;
but it's important that we understand what is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:45.120
question we're asking and what is the question&nbsp;
that we are answering? The vaccine mandate is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:52.240
working now. These thirty four officers, they&nbsp;
may well find themselves looking around wondering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:57.920
what happened to my pension, what happened to my&nbsp;
salary? What happened to my health care coverage?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:06.480
They may regret this decision. OK, but the point&nbsp;
is it's only 34 individuals. I also would expect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:16.560
that many of these 34 are mad at the rest of the&nbsp;
36000 that went ahead and got vaccinated. OK, that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:22.720
is a really common thing in these situations where&nbsp;
those who are the ones that are the outliers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:26.720
those who are the ones that are doing what&nbsp;
