00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:32.160
or their families or their jobs are for anything.&nbsp;
They will be mad at everybody else for caving&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:39.520
to the man and complying, etc.. Also, big&nbsp;
picture step back and think about the numbers&nbsp;&nbsp;

