00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:50.000
80 percent of U.S. adults are what we would&nbsp;
call at least partially vaccinated right now.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:57.920
There's probably a bunch of lying going on about&nbsp;
people claiming not to be vaccinated and actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:02.800
being vaccinated for social pressure reasons.&nbsp;
Anecdotally, we know this is true. We saw a&nbsp;&nbsp;

